#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :mod:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets` module provides a family of equation-"
"based generators for various datasets that are commonly used in machine-"
"learning research. Every generator derives from "
":class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.dataset.Dataset` and exposes a common "
":meth:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.dataset.Dataset.generate` method:"
msgstr ""
"El módulo :mod:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets` proporciona una familia de "
"generadores basados en ecuaciones para diversos conjuntos de datos de uso "
"habitual en la investigación en aprendizaje automático. Todos los "
"generadores derivan de :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.dataset.Dataset` y "
"exponen un método :meth:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.dataset.Dataset.generate` "
"común:"

#: ../../modules/ml/ml_datasets.rst:17
msgid ""
"The returned :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.dataset.DatasetSample` is an "
"``(inputs, targets)`` pair."
msgstr ""
"El :class:`~qilisdk.ml.datasets.dataset.DatasetSample` devuelto es un par "
"``(inputs, targets)``."

